node.doctext:
Hi all,

I was using PERL Win32 OLE to open multiples csv files and save as 1 Excel file.
This was quick and fast.
<code>
use Win32::OLE;
use Win32::OLE qw(in with);
use Win32::OLE::Const 'Microsoft Excel';
</code>

I just switch to a new system and I don't have Excel 32-bit on this system (only 64-bit). I cannot use Win32::OLE libraries any more.

Is my next bet is to use:
<code>
use Text::CSV;
use Spreadsheet::WriteExcel;
</code>
Open each csv and write to Excel file?

Thanks.
